    "Scan of the 1953 edition of the Olalla, Washington, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey. Aerial photographs from 1978; field checked in 1953; photo revised in 1981; last revised in 1981; printed in 1982.",
